      "settlement": "Wagriolyn",
      "settlementKey": "earrorim:Wagriolyn",
      "description": "Tedd Wright is a Dwarf physician who has patched up too many fog-bitten sailors, sick children, zealot converts, and ichor-burned fools to waste breath on melodrama. At the Wagriolyn Tavern, he treats wounds, addiction, exposure, and bad decisions with equal steadiness, keeping his patients alive even when he disapproves of how they got hurt. Tedd is kind in the unromantic way of exhausted doctors: he will scold you while saving your life and then make sure someone walks you home.",
      "settlementAndAncestryTexture": "Wagriolyn is a City in Earrorim, under Federal Republic, with elevated danger, Farming, Beach and reefs with water, Beach and grass with water terrain. Local records favor Altruistic, Lawful, Cooperative, Honorable civic habits; common communities include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Halfling — Stout Halfling, Kender, Kithkin. Dwarf reads through the Dwarf entry of the race compendium, within Dwarven and Gnomish Kin, marked by Marduthor. Dwarves are stout, resilient folk deeply tied to stone, craft, and ancestral tradition. They value honor, craftsmanship, and enduring legacies over fleeting trends. Table cues: Darkvision, Dwarven Resilience, Dwarven Toughness, Stonecunning; starting tendency Neutral - Lawful - Cooperative - Honorable.",
      "rumors": [
        "Tedd Wright knows why an ichor ledger changed hands last Sigranday.",
